Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.18,0:02:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  我说了注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. I said heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.86,0:03:00.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.11,0:03:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在外面干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,角落里还有一瓶水\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another water bottle in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿上就走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:11.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不回答我吗 \N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:20.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大里怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened in Alexandria?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:25.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们听到了那声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:38.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了总是会发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened is what always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.79,0:04:41.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.09,0:04:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们冲破了围墙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The herd broke through the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What herd?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸群\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.24,0:04:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们提前冲出了采石场\N{\fnArial\fs30}They broke out of the quarry early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们引走了它们  但那汽笛声\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got on them, but that sound, the air horn,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:04:57.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Maggie okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.94,0:05:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:35.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Enid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.01,0:06:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:26.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没聊过  我们该聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't talked. We should.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚点聊  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没必要经常上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be up here so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是他回来的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the direction he'd come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他发信号  就会在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he sends up a signal, it'll be from out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者不会有信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it-- it won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们出去时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we go out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来都不容易  不轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's never easy, it's never simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会有战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但更难的情况我们都挺过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've come back from harder things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更远的距离我们也回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}From further away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, Daryl,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:08:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕和萨沙  他们也可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham, and Sasha, they will, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们不应该干等着他们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we don't wait for them to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该开始想想怎样把行尸引走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should start figuring out how to draw the walkers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.41,0:09:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的食物和水还能支撑一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have some food and water to last us a while
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:15.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙也还撑得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the walls are holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好想清楚  把这事干好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really think this through. Do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清理干净  这样他们就能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear it so they can--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就能直接走进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can walk right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有天看见朱迪思在屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Judith in the house the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.39,0:09:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她开始...\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's starting to--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她开始长得像洛莉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's starting to look like Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -这让我挺开心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(贝琪  亲爱的  如果你在看这张纸条  那说明我没能活着回去)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(今日1点  在太阳能板处  举行祈祷圈活动)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:55.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你初次尝试还是用手枪比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handguns will be a little better for your first go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装弹  上膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magazine release. Slide release.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拇指保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thumb safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那算简单的  是不是  老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stuff's easy, right, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  空的弹夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Empty magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-空的枪膛  看到了吗  -看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Empty chamber. See it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在你前面  他们手里有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's in front of you, they have a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会害怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体会紧绷  你没时间思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body's gonna tense, you won't have time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你面对这种情况时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna want to pull the trigger
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:28.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会只想着扣下扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you get it in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你会打偏\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll miss
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:37.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得把枪举到与眼睛平行的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get it up to your eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得足够坚强  耐心等到一个好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be strong enough to wait for your moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能... \N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I, uh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手指不能碰扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, your finger doesn't touch the trigger
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你准备好开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you're ready to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那把枪你留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep that one with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,体会体会随身配枪是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a feel of what it's like to carry one around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I shoot it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许可以朝着行尸开枪什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe like down at the walkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  照现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, with things how they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙足够坚固能抵挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}the walls are strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:26.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但幸运的是行尸慢慢散开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're lucky the walkers are spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不想把它们全部引到一个点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to pull them all to one spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:30.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那...在镇中心练习打靶可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about, like, target practice in the center of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那样声音就会四散开来\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause then the sound will spread out in each direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者我们可以安个消声器之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe we could use, like, silencers or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在最好还是别浪费子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we probably don't want to waste bullets right now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想多学一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just want to learn more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.17,0:13:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在做...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was making--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想来点燕麦粥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want some oatmeal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:28.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢  不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I'm-- I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你刚刚在门边晃悠  有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were coming to the door. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要我看看你手臂上的伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want me to take a look at your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我来不是为了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not here for--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事可以告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell me if you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:14:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在方便谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:09.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我回来的路上...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was coming back...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.35,0:15:15.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试图用车挡住行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to cut off the herd with the RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引开它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead the walkers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但有五个额头上刻着W的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But five of those people with the Ws in their foreheads,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我拦下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想杀我  朝车子开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to kill me, shot up the RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔告诉我  她看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Carol says she saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愿意杀死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you wouldn't kill those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你放走他们的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you let any of them go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:47.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想杀死五个我没必要杀的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to kill five people I didn't have to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可他们活活烧死人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They burned people alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.95,0:16:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  在金恩郡那会儿 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you kill me, Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}back in King County?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你亮刀  试图捅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulled a knife on you. I stabbed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.11,0:16:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么不杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why didn't you kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你从医院出来后我救了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it 'cause I saved you after the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我知道你的为人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I knew who you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那会儿我一看见你就会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back there I would have killed you as soon as look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你饶了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, you let me live
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才有了后来我帮助亚伦和达里尔脱险\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I was there to help Aaron and Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧  如果我不在场...\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, if I-- if I wasn't there...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们死了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they died...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些狼或许就不会来这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe those wolves wouldn't have been able to come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经分不清对错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's right anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我明明就很想杀死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I did want to kill those man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:56.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到他们为非作歹  恶性不改\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seen what they did, what they'd keep doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:17:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明知可以了结此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I could end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我也知道人是可以改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I also know that people can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在座的每位都改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause everyone sitting here has.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有生命都是宝贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All life is precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而那个想法  那个想法改变了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that idea-- that idea changed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我重获新生  让我活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It brought me back and it keeps me living.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得  没那么容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't think it can be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-并不容易  -我的意思不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not easy. - I wasn't saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想过要放弃那种想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've thought about letting that idea go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:34.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你必须放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情没有说起来那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things aren't as simple as four words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think they ever were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.00,0:17:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我不该留在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I don't belong here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为你能手不沾血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you really think you can do that without getting blood on your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:17:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能想办法到墙外去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can somehow get outside the walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到采石场的车子那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}get back to our cars at the quarry,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.61,0:18:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就能用车子引走它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could use them to draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要建立更多哨点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll set up more watch points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,协调射击枪支和信号弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coordinate the shooting of guns and flares
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就能把它们分散引走\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we could pull them out in even directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.82,0:18:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得用上所有我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd need to get all our people on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  塔拉  罗西塔  卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, Tara, Rosita, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about everybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.27,0:19:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前我们先不告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's just keep this to our own for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:08.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们有时间带上大家  那当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if we had the time to bring the people along, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们连歇口气的机会都没有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we haven't had a chance to catch our breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在这个社区里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们正在歇息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're catching our breath right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.93,0:19:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的都是借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else is just excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.64,0:19:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.85,0:19:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:41.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扩张计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plans for the expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在有其他的事情要忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a few other things on our plate right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情结束之后  可以这样建设亚历山大\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are for what Alexandria can be after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:53.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because one way or another,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事都会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's gonna be an after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀砍进去后  不要立刻拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, when the blade connects, don't jerk it right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:08.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你会被卡住  -被卡住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll get stuck. - Stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像斧子砍进树里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an ax cutting into a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把刀砍进骨头容易  拔出来难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easier to get a blade into bone than out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那应该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用砍刀顺着伤口向下划出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should slide the machete down through the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.69,0:20:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作要连续\N{\fnArial\fs30}One fluid motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样划过骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you ease it through the bone like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个手握砍刀的武器菜鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a weapons novice holding a significant blade here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.85,0:20:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我周围有人穿着露脚面的鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there are people in my proximity with open-toed shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:43.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  所以振作点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. So get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在怕什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you so scared of?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:54.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.59,0:20:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:58.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都停止了  你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all just stops. You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你周围的人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people around you dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.31,0:21:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才是最难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:06.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗  因为你继续活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? 'Cause you keep living
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心里想着他们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing that they're gone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最应该害怕的是继续活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you should be scared of is living
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时心里愧疚着自己没能尽力保护好他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing that you didn't do everything you could to keep them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难受得坚持不下去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too upset to keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:29.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噪音吓着你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the noises scaring you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能继续讲课了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or can I get back to my lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再来一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么给我水喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you give me water?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.91,0:22:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有水  你需要水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had it, you needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.23,0:22:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不代表我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't make us friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是朋友  我是因为玛姬才这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not friends. I'm doing this for Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.93,0:22:38.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的妻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.75,0:22:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不会抛下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.87,0:22:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她肯定也不希望我抛下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't want me to leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.93,0:22:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.91,0:22:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你妻子也不是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not friends with your wife either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.52,0:22:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想跟你商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not having this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会把你丢在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving you out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.21,0:22:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.62,0:23:18.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪给我  伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the gun, Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.33,0:23:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转身走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.29,0:23:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你逼我的话  我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will if you make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.91,0:23:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.74,0:23:42.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿枪指着我还叫我混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You point a gun at me and I'm the asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.55,0:23:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.93,0:23:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走后门去小巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out the back down the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走大路  需要开阔的视野\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking the road. We need visibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.95,0:23:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:23:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为半数尸群离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because half the herd broke off
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.99,0:24:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们正在往家走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're headed towards home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.18,0:24:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你没碰上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you missed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.82,0:24:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:24:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去需要一些帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you could use some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.76,0:25:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们可以给这玩意儿造一个支架\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think we could build up a brace on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.71,0:25:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.27,0:25:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你妻子不希望我杀了它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think your wife wouldn't have wanted me to kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.79,0:26:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以利用它们引开行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use them to distract them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.79,0:26:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灌木丛中有一个氦气罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a helium tank in those shrubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.11,0:26:15.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有更多气球和绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}More balloons, more string.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.46,0:26:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要支撑好  墙就没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It don't mean anything as long as we keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.53,0:26:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚见到你时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you scared the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.49,0:26:46.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把大家都吓了一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}hell out of people when we first saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.74,0:26:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.31,0:26:53.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我吓了一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.57,0:26:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}With that beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.97,0:26:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你环顾四周的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you looked around
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像你看到了什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you were seeing things we weren't...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.39,0:27:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没看到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding around corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.49,0:27:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果真的是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:16.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来这里节奏很慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things moved slow here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.99,0:27:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你一来  一切都加快了步伐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then things just started moving fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.62,0:27:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.99,0:27:26.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不要放弃我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't give up on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.34,0:27:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在家里的时候跟谁住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did you stay with back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.45,0:27:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.50,0:27:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我住在奥利维亚那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lived in Olivia's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.89,0:27:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我靠我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.29,0:28:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸夺走了我的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orphaned by walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.10,0:28:08.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.36,0:28:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.75,0:28:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.00,0:28:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get that you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.39,0:28:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.77,0:28:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是很怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.82,0:28:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想再失去什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to lose anything again,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.57,0:28:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你放弃了  说"事情就是这样"\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you give up and you say, "That's just what happens."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.22,0:28:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不需要说教  -我觉得你需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't need a lecture. - Yeah, I think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.03,0:28:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你通过活下去来尊重死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honor the dead by going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.60,0:28:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使当你害怕的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.91,0:28:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你活着是因为他们牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live because they don't get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.34,0:28:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为害怕就举着枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think your parents wanted you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.79,0:29:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你父母会想让你那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}waving around a gun because you're afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.83,0:29:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不必聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.47,0:29:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不必聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.96,0:29:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.17,0:30:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.63,0:30:33.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.54,0:30:36.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.15,0:30:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.28,0:30:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界在自取灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is trying to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.92,0:30:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不应该去插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to just let it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.98,0:30:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.09,0:30:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.27,0:30:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not supposed to let the world die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.41,0:31:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我肯定也不会让你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I sure as hell am not gonna let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.02,0:31:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定你妻子会原谅你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure your wife will forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.85,0:31:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不再是为了她才这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for her anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.39,0:31:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙还没有倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the walls are still up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.05,0:31:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房子也还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The houses are still up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.78,0:31:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到其他人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find out the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.89,0:31:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.25,0:31:31.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.19,0:31:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.16,0:31:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞  回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Spencer, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.25,0:31:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.21,0:31:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.02,0:31:58.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞  快给我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer, get back here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.79,0:32:03.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞  快爬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer. Spencer, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.04,0:32:17.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  继续爬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.09,0:32:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快点  -尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry! - Eugene...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.63,0:32:21.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让玛姬和罗西塔从岗哨处开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}have Maggie and Rosita fire their guns out from their posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.01,0:32:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -照做就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.20,0:32:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-塔拉  我良心会不安的  -快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tara, I cannot in good conscience-- - Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.52,0:32:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞  上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.74,0:33:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.16,0:33:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉  你已经为这些人差点死过一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara! You almost died once for these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.44,0:33:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -你他妈的在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What the hell were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.40,0:33:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丢了只鞋  该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost a damn shoe. Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:39.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.96,0:33:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在帮忙  想找辆车引开它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to help. I wanted to get to a car, draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.03,0:33:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前这样爬过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever make a climb like that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.90,0:33:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想帮忙的话  就不要让我们反过来救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to help? Don't make us come running to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.66,0:33:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么主意  你先给我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got an idea, you come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.87,0:33:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会听我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you have listened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.79,0:34:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在没事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.14,0:34:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.78,0:34:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.34,0:34:32.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的小抄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheat sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.41,0:34:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.97,0:34:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,估计没能给你多少信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably doesn't give you a lot of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.61,0:34:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.75,0:34:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须有信念不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you have to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.30,0:34:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是必须  是我选择的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to. I choose to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.67,0:34:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.34,0:34:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次你会告诉我你来干什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you gonna tell me why you're here this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.59,0:35:00.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社区的抗生素库存如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How well is the community stocked with antibiotics?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.30,0:35:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.49,0:35:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得包扎伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to dress a wound,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.80,0:35:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不知道有没有感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know if it's infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.61,0:35:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要的话我不想浪费药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to waste medicine if I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.08,0:35:13.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧热红脓痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}FWoPP'RS.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.06,0:35:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发烧  发热  脓  疼痛和发红\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fever, warmth, pus, pain, redness...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.02,0:35:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.97,0:35:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水肿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.17,0:35:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看你的手臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a look at your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.92,0:35:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早上没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't come in this morning
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.21,0:35:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不想让你卷入到\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I didn't want to get you involved in something
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.49,0:35:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你或许不愿卷入的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you may not want to be involved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.82,0:35:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.21,0:35:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.97,0:36:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你早上才照看了朱迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you just took care of Judith this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.89,0:36:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但斯宾塞那事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they want some help with the watch points
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.34,0:36:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哨岗需要人手  你能不能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}after that thing with Spencer. Could you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.18,0:36:57.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.41,0:36:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你想让我替你的班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want me to take your shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.80,0:37:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用  我喜欢在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I like being up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.74,0:37:03.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使那么多行尸在外面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with all them outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.38,0:37:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能看到一切  包括里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see everything. Even inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.87,0:37:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这些先放好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, let me just lock these up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.97,0:37:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能稍等会儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give me a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.32,0:37:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你要进来吗  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want to come in? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.79,0:37:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.70,0:37:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.55,0:37:31.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.69,0:37:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.19,0:37:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你接受不了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if you can't live with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.08,0:37:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你  那会打垮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, it eats you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.82,0:37:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能下来吗  我听不清你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you come down here? I can barely hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.01,0:37:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people who came,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.09,0:37:52.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是怪物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}were they the monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.39,0:37:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸变成怪物了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did my dad turn into one?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.09,0:37:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.29,0:38:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you kill people,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.14,0:38:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会变成怪物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you turn into one of the monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.78,0:38:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有杀人才不会变成怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that keeps you from becoming a monster is killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.76,0:38:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢帮忙  -小事一桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you for this. - Oh, yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.06,0:38:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.99,0:38:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在里面关着谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell do you have in that cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.77,0:39:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到丹妮斯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you seen Denise?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.56,0:39:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.77,0:39:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.46,0:39:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  之前的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.54,0:39:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我只是...  -他很蠢  这点我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was just-- - He was stupid. That we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.26,0:39:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  你不必为他那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just meant what you did for him, you didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.23,0:39:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.81,0:39:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有可能会死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.13,0:40:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说我想过这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'd like to say I was thinking about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.37,0:40:02.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.32,0:40:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才那样做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.31,0:40:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你没好好想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't thinking about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.49,0:40:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们就该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's how it works with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.58,0:40:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离不开彼此了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're stuck with each other, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.79,0:40:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  你救了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, you saved my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.61,0:40:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.52,0:40:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢塔拉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.16,0:40:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经谢过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.65,0:40:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我要感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.42,0:40:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞做的事很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Spencer did was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.33,0:40:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没法反驳这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't argue that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.57,0:40:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-至少他试过  -这不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At least he tried. - That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.35,0:40:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才是真有可能试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.90,0:40:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.85,0:40:44.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.97,0:40:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸追他时  出现了空隙\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the walkers were going for him, it made a gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.57,0:40:51.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以跳下去  跑出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have jumped down, ran, made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.54,0:40:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以坐上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have got in a car,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.50,0:40:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用车引走行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}used it to lead the walkers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.17,0:40:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以那样做  然后斯宾塞就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have done that and Spencer would be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.97,0:41:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你没有那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.66,0:41:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.54,0:41:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我救他是因为他是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped save him because he's your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.68,0:41:10.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.79,0:41:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是格伦  那是格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Glenn. That's Glenn.
